          "content": "12. Tasneem wants to make a metre scale by herself. She considers the following materials for it—plywood, paper, cloth, stretchable rubber and steel. Which of these should she not use and why?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.166,
            0.744,
            0.205
          ],
          "content": "13. Think, design and develop a card game on conversion of units of length to play with your friends."
