            0.297,
            0.744,
            0.36
          ],
          "content": " Can you find the thickness of a single page of your notebook or textbook using a scale? Think of a way and write it. Carry out the activity and report your result."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.372,
            0.744,
            0.454
          ],
          "content": "Collect fallen leaves from the same tree. Identify the name of the tree whose leaves you have taken. Measure length and breadth of all these leaves using a 15-cm scale, as shown in Fig. 5.20. Record your observations in the Table 5.7."
